# Files kept in the repo but not uploaded to Cloudflare Workers assets.
# wrangler.jsonc sets assets.directory to ".", so without this the whole repo
# ships, including ~53 MB of masters the site never requests.

# Audio masters. The site plays media/tracks/track-0N-highlight.m4a.
*.wav

# Cover masters (3000-4000px). The site uses media/tracks/*-cover-web.jpg.
media/tracks/track-01-cover.jpg
media/tracks/track-02-cover.jpg
media/tracks/track-03-cover.png
media/tracks/track-04-cover.jpg
media/tracks/README.txt

# Source banner (10667x6000). The share card is brand_assets/og-banner.jpg.
brand_assets/banner.png
brand_assets/vision.txt
brand_assets/links.txt

